BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Kaïros — Madrid
DTSTART;TZID="UTC+01:00":20261105T190000
DTEND;TZID="UTC+01:00":20261105T190000
DTSTAMP:20261106T192748Z
UID:2fe3103b267324d89ba738e2286f@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Multidisciplinary\,Madrid\,Spain
DESCRIPTION:Tras un año rodando en el extranjero\, Manu\, un actor de 39 
 años que en su día gozó de gran reconocimiento\, regresa a su ciudad na
 tal e intenta abrirse de nuevo camino en la industria. Contra todo pronós
 tico\, consigue un trabajo como presentador de un programa nocturno de rad
 io con llamadas en directo. En plena crisis existencial\, Manu utiliza ese
  espacio para dar voz a las preguntas filosóficas que lo atormentan duran
 te las largas noches. A través de sus conversaciones con los oyentes\, un
  grupo de almas solitarias\, su vida comienza a cobrar un nuevo sentido. >
  Coloquio posterior con Jennifer Alleyn Panorama internacional Nacida en S
 uiza\, Jennifer Alleyn es una cineasta\, escritora y fotógrafa\nCategory:
  Multidisciplinary\nOriginal listing: https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/sc
 hedule/film-women-madrid-2026
LOCATION:Sala Borau\, Plaza de Legazpi\, 8\, Madrid\, 28045
STATUS:CANCELLED
URL:https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedule/film-women-madrid-2026
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:europe
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:matadero-madrid
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Take Off (None of This Should Have Happened) — Madrid
DTSTART;TZID="UTC+01:00":20261105T193000
DTEND;TZID="UTC+01:00":20261115T235555
DTSTAMP:20261106T192748Z
UID:4769529a0a749e24ade9f9924495@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Multidisciplinary\,Madrid\,Spain
DESCRIPTION:“MAYBE SOMETHING NEW WILL ARISE FROM THE DISASTER” Some ev
 ents are so improbable that they are called accidents. Accidents demand an
  explanation. Looking back. Finding the oversight\, the logical flaw\, the
  error. Understanding. And learning. In Take Off \, José Padilla reconstr
 ucts the deadliest disaster in civil aviation history. It took place on Ma
 rch 27\, 1977\, on the runway at Los Rodeos Airport (Tenerife). Two Boeing
  747s collided on the runway before takeoff. 587 people died. That is the 
 accident. Now for the explanation. On stage\, Carlota Gaviño\, Almudena P
 uyo\, Kevin de la Rosa\, and Lucía Trentini seek it out\, bringing passen
 gers\, pilots\, air traffic controllers\, announcers\, and narrator\nCateg
 ory: Multidisciplinary\nOriginal listing: https://www.mataderomadrid.org/e
 n/schedule/take-none-should-have-happened
LOCATION:Naves Matadero\, Plaza de Legazpi\, 8\, Madrid\, 28045
STATUS:CANCELLED
URL:https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedule/take-none-should-have-happe
 ned
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:europe
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:matadero-madrid
END:VEVENT
