BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Family Workshop: 'The Body of Flamenco' — Madrid
DTSTART;TZID="UTC+01:00":20261108T120000
DTEND;TZID="UTC+01:00":20261108T120000
DTSTAMP:20261106T192748Z
UID:9e24b9247339f1222d822724e2a0@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Multidisciplinary\,Madrid\,Spain
DESCRIPTION:Through playful activities and practical exercises\, we will w
 ork on body awareness\, rhythm\, coordination\, and the relationship betwe
 en movement and music. We will explore the body’s sonic possibilities th
 rough hand-clapping ( palmas )\, footwork\, and other resources\, discover
 ing how rhythm can become a tool for dancing and communicating. All of thi
 s will be conducted using a participatory methodology adapted to the parti
 cipants' ages\, inviting everyone to enjoy dance as a space for discovery
 \, play\, and creation.\nCategory: Multidisciplinary\nOriginal listing: ht
 tps://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedule/family-workshop-body-flamenco
LOCATION:Centro Danza Matadero\, Plaza de Legazpi\, 8\, Madrid\, 28045
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedule/family-workshop-body-flamen
 co
